{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Decart adapter provides access to Decart's image and video generation models."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\",\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage-custom-api-key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage - Custom API Key"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createDecartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst adapter = createDecartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\", process.env.DECART_API_KEY!);\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter,\n  prompt: \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\",\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createDecartImage, type DecartImageConfig } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst config: Omit<DecartImageConfig, \"apiKey\"> = {\n  baseUrl: \"https://api.decart.ai\", // Optional, for custom endpoints\n};\n\nconst adapter = createDecartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\", process.env.DECART_API_KEY!, config);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"image-generation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image Generation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generate images with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lucy-pro-t2i"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A futuristic cityscape at night\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.images[0]?.b64Json);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"image-model-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image Model Options"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A portrait of a robot artist\",\n  modelOptions: {\n    resolution: \"720p\",\n    orientation: \"portrait\",\n    seed: 42,\n  },\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resolution"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"720p\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"720p\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output resolution"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"orientation"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"portrait\" | \"landscape\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"landscape\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image orientation"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"seed"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"-"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Seed for reproducible generation"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"video-generation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Video Generation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Video generation uses an async job/polling architecture."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"creating-a-video-job","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creating a Video Job"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateVideo } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst { jobId } = await generateVideo({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  prompt: \"A cat playing with a ball of yarn\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"Job started:\", jobId);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"polling-for-status","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Polling for Status"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { getVideoJobStatus } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst jobId = \"example-job-id\";\nconst status = await getVideoJobStatus({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  jobId,\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"Status:\", status.status); // \"pending\" | \"processing\" | \"completed\" | \"failed\"\n\nif (status.status === \"completed\" && status.url) {\n  console.log(\"Video URL:\", status.url);\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"complete-example-with-polling","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Complete Example with Polling"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateVideo, getVideoJobStatus } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nasync function createVideo(prompt: string) {\n  const adapter = decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\");\n\n  // Create the job\n  const { jobId } = await generateVideo({ adapter, prompt });\n  console.log(\"Job created:\", jobId);\n\n  // Poll for completion\n  let status = \"pending\";\n  while (status !== \"completed\" && status !== \"failed\") {\n    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 5000));\n\n    const result = await getVideoJobStatus({ adapter, jobId });\n    status = result.status;\n    console.log(`Status: ${status}`);\n\n    if (result.status === \"failed\") {\n      throw new Error(\"Video generation failed\");\n    }\n\n    if (result.status === \"completed\" && result.url) {\n      return result.url;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst videoUrl = await createVideo(\"A drone shot over a tropical beach\");","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"video-model-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Video Model Options"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateVideo } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst { jobId } = await generateVideo({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  prompt: \"A timelapse of a blooming flower\",\n  modelOptions: {\n    resolution: \"720p\",\n    orientation: \"landscape\",\n    seed: 42,\n  },\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resolution"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"720p\" | \"480p\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"720p\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output resolution"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"orientation"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"portrait\" | \"landscape\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"landscape\""}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Video orientation"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"seed"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"-"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Seed for reproducible generation"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"environment-variables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment Variables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set your API key in environment variables:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"DECART_API_KEY=your-api-key-here","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"getting-an-api-key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Getting an API Key"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Go to "},{"type":"link","href":"https://platform.decart.ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Decart Platform"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create an account and generate an API key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add it to your environment variables"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api-reference","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"decartimage-model-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"decartImage(model, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Decart image adapter using environment variables."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - Model name ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"lucy-pro-t2i\""},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.baseUrl?"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL (optional)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Decart image adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createdecartimage-model-apikey-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createDecartImage(model, apiKey, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Decart image adapter with an explicit API key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - Model name ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"lucy-pro-t2i\""},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"apiKey"},{"type":"text","value":" - Your Decart API key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.baseUrl?"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL (optional)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Decart image adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"decartvideo-model-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"decartVideo(model, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Decart video adapter using environment variables."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - Model name ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"lucy-pro-t2v\""},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.baseUrl?"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL (optional)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Decart video adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createdecartvideo-model-apikey-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createDecartVideo(model, apiKey, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Decart video adapter with an explicit API key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - Model name ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"lucy-pro-t2v\""},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"apiKey"},{"type":"text","value":" - Your Decart API key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.baseUrl?"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL (optional)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Decart video adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://platform.decart.ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Decart Platform"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Visit Decart's platform to generate API keys"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://docs.platform.decart.ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Documentation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - View complete API reference"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/decartai/tanstack-ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Repository"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Explore the adapter source code"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../media/image-generation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image Generation Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Learn about image generation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../media/video-generation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Video Generation Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Learn about video generation"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"basic-usage","text":"Basic Usage","level":2},{"id":"basic-usage-custom-api-key","text":"Basic Usage - Custom API Key","level":2},{"id":"configuration","text":"Configuration","level":2},{"id":"image-generation","text":"Image Generation","level":2},{"id":"image-model-options","text":"Image Model Options","level":3},{"id":"video-generation","text":"Video Generation","level":2},{"id":"creating-a-video-job","text":"Creating a Video Job","level":3},{"id":"polling-for-status","text":"Polling for Status","level":3},{"id":"complete-example-with-polling","text":"Complete Example with Polling","level":3},{"id":"video-model-options","text":"Video Model Options","level":3},{"id":"environment-variables","text":"Environment Variables","level":2},{"id":"getting-an-api-key","text":"Getting an API Key","level":2},{"id":"api-reference","text":"API Reference","level":2},{"id":"decartimage-model-config","text":"decartImage(model, config?)","level":3},{"id":"createdecartimage-model-apikey-config","text":"createDecartImage(model, apiKey, config?)","level":3},{"id":"decartvideo-model-config","text":"decartVideo(model, config?)","level":3},{"id":"createdecartvideo-model-apikey-config","text":"createDecartVideo(model, apiKey, config?)","level":3},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","vue","solid","svelte","preact","angular","vanilla","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe Decart adapter provides access to Decart's image and video generation models.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nvue: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nsolid: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nsvelte: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\npreact: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nangular: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nvanilla: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\noctane: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\",\n});\n```\n\n## Basic Usage - Custom API Key\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createDecartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst adapter = createDecartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\", process.env.DECART_API_KEY!);\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter,\n  prompt: \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\",\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```typescript\nimport { createDecartImage, type DecartImageConfig } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst config: Omit<DecartImageConfig, \"apiKey\"> = {\n  baseUrl: \"https://api.decart.ai\", // Optional, for custom endpoints\n};\n\nconst adapter = createDecartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\", process.env.DECART_API_KEY!, config);\n```\n\n## Image Generation\n\nGenerate images with `lucy-pro-t2i`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A futuristic cityscape at night\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.images[0]?.b64Json);\n```\n\n### Image Model Options\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A portrait of a robot artist\",\n  modelOptions: {\n    resolution: \"720p\",\n    orientation: \"portrait\",\n    seed: 42,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `resolution` | `\"720p\"` | `\"720p\"` | Output resolution |\n| `orientation` | `\"portrait\" \\| \"landscape\"` | `\"landscape\"` | Image orientation |\n| `seed` | `number` | - | Seed for reproducible generation |\n\n## Video Generation\n\nVideo generation uses an async job/polling architecture.\n\n### Creating a Video Job\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateVideo } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst { jobId } = await generateVideo({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  prompt: \"A cat playing with a ball of yarn\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"Job started:\", jobId);\n```\n\n### Polling for Status\n\n```typescript\nimport { getVideoJobStatus } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst jobId = \"example-job-id\";\nconst status = await getVideoJobStatus({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  jobId,\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"Status:\", status.status); // \"pending\" | \"processing\" | \"completed\" | \"failed\"\n\nif (status.status === \"completed\" && status.url) {\n  console.log(\"Video URL:\", status.url);\n}\n```\n\n### Complete Example with Polling\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateVideo, getVideoJobStatus } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nasync function createVideo(prompt: string) {\n  const adapter = decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\");\n\n  // Create the job\n  const { jobId } = await generateVideo({ adapter, prompt });\n  console.log(\"Job created:\", jobId);\n\n  // Poll for completion\n  let status = \"pending\";\n  while (status !== \"completed\" && status !== \"failed\") {\n    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 5000));\n\n    const result = await getVideoJobStatus({ adapter, jobId });\n    status = result.status;\n    console.log(`Status: ${status}`);\n\n    if (result.status === \"failed\") {\n      throw new Error(\"Video generation failed\");\n    }\n\n    if (result.status === \"completed\" && result.url) {\n      return result.url;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst videoUrl = await createVideo(\"A drone shot over a tropical beach\");\n```\n\n### Video Model Options\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateVideo } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst { jobId } = await generateVideo({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  prompt: \"A timelapse of a blooming flower\",\n  modelOptions: {\n    resolution: \"720p\",\n    orientation: \"landscape\",\n    seed: 42,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `resolution` | `\"720p\" \\| \"480p\"` | `\"720p\"` | Output resolution |\n| `orientation` | `\"portrait\" \\| \"landscape\"` | `\"landscape\"` | Video orientation |\n| `seed` | `number` | - | Seed for reproducible generation |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nSet your API key in environment variables:\n\n```bash\nDECART_API_KEY=your-api-key-here\n```\n\n## Getting an API Key\n\n1. Go to [Decart Platform](https://platform.decart.ai)\n2. Create an account and generate an API key\n3. Add it to your environment variables\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `decartImage(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart image adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2i\"`)\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart image adapter instance.\n\n### `createDecartImage(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart image adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2i\"`)\n- `apiKey` - Your Decart API key\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart image adapter instance.\n\n### `decartVideo(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart video adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2v\"`)\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart video adapter instance.\n\n### `createDecartVideo(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart video adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2v\"`)\n- `apiKey` - Your Decart API key\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart video adapter instance.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Decart Platform](https://platform.decart.ai) - Visit Decart's platform to generate API keys\n- [API Documentation](https://docs.platform.decart.ai) - View complete API reference\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/decartai/tanstack-ai) - Explore the adapter source code\n- [Image Generation Guide](../media/image-generation) - Learn about image generation\n- [Video Generation Guide](../media/video-generation) - Learn about video generation\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Decart\nid: decart-adapter\norder: 2\ndescription: \"Generate images and videos with Decart's AI models in TanStack AI via the Decart community adapter.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - decart\n  - image generation\n  - video generation\n  - community adapter\n---\n\nThe Decart adapter provides access to Decart's image and video generation models.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nvue: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nsolid: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nsvelte: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\npreact: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nangular: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\nvanilla: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\noctane: @decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\",\n});\n```\n\n## Basic Usage - Custom API Key\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createDecartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst adapter = createDecartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\", process.env.DECART_API_KEY!);\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter,\n  prompt: \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\",\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```typescript\nimport { createDecartImage, type DecartImageConfig } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst config: Omit<DecartImageConfig, \"apiKey\"> = {\n  baseUrl: \"https://api.decart.ai\", // Optional, for custom endpoints\n};\n\nconst adapter = createDecartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\", process.env.DECART_API_KEY!, config);\n```\n\n## Image Generation\n\nGenerate images with `lucy-pro-t2i`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A futuristic cityscape at night\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.images[0]?.b64Json);\n```\n\n### Image Model Options\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartImage } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: decartImage(\"lucy-pro-t2i\"),\n  prompt: \"A portrait of a robot artist\",\n  modelOptions: {\n    resolution: \"720p\",\n    orientation: \"portrait\",\n    seed: 42,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `resolution` | `\"720p\"` | `\"720p\"` | Output resolution |\n| `orientation` | `\"portrait\" \\| \"landscape\"` | `\"landscape\"` | Image orientation |\n| `seed` | `number` | - | Seed for reproducible generation |\n\n## Video Generation\n\nVideo generation uses an async job/polling architecture.\n\n### Creating a Video Job\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateVideo } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst { jobId } = await generateVideo({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  prompt: \"A cat playing with a ball of yarn\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"Job started:\", jobId);\n```\n\n### Polling for Status\n\n```typescript\nimport { getVideoJobStatus } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst jobId = \"example-job-id\";\nconst status = await getVideoJobStatus({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  jobId,\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"Status:\", status.status); // \"pending\" | \"processing\" | \"completed\" | \"failed\"\n\nif (status.status === \"completed\" && status.url) {\n  console.log(\"Video URL:\", status.url);\n}\n```\n\n### Complete Example with Polling\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateVideo, getVideoJobStatus } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nasync function createVideo(prompt: string) {\n  const adapter = decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\");\n\n  // Create the job\n  const { jobId } = await generateVideo({ adapter, prompt });\n  console.log(\"Job created:\", jobId);\n\n  // Poll for completion\n  let status = \"pending\";\n  while (status !== \"completed\" && status !== \"failed\") {\n    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 5000));\n\n    const result = await getVideoJobStatus({ adapter, jobId });\n    status = result.status;\n    console.log(`Status: ${status}`);\n\n    if (result.status === \"failed\") {\n      throw new Error(\"Video generation failed\");\n    }\n\n    if (result.status === \"completed\" && result.url) {\n      return result.url;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst videoUrl = await createVideo(\"A drone shot over a tropical beach\");\n```\n\n### Video Model Options\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateVideo } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { decartVideo } from \"@decartai/tanstack-ai-adapter\";\n\nconst { jobId } = await generateVideo({\n  adapter: decartVideo(\"lucy-pro-t2v\"),\n  prompt: \"A timelapse of a blooming flower\",\n  modelOptions: {\n    resolution: \"720p\",\n    orientation: \"landscape\",\n    seed: 42,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `resolution` | `\"720p\" \\| \"480p\"` | `\"720p\"` | Output resolution |\n| `orientation` | `\"portrait\" \\| \"landscape\"` | `\"landscape\"` | Video orientation |\n| `seed` | `number` | - | Seed for reproducible generation |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nSet your API key in environment variables:\n\n```bash\nDECART_API_KEY=your-api-key-here\n```\n\n## Getting an API Key\n\n1. Go to [Decart Platform](https://platform.decart.ai)\n2. Create an account and generate an API key\n3. Add it to your environment variables\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `decartImage(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart image adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2i\"`)\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart image adapter instance.\n\n### `createDecartImage(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart image adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2i\"`)\n- `apiKey` - Your Decart API key\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart image adapter instance.\n\n### `decartVideo(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart video adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2v\"`)\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart video adapter instance.\n\n### `createDecartVideo(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Decart video adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - Model name (`\"lucy-pro-t2v\"`)\n- `apiKey` - Your Decart API key\n- `config.baseUrl?` - Custom base URL (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Decart video adapter instance.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Decart Platform](https://platform.decart.ai) - Visit Decart's platform to generate API keys\n- [API Documentation](https://docs.platform.decart.ai) - View complete API reference\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/decartai/tanstack-ai) - Explore the adapter source code\n- [Image Generation Guide](../media/image-generation) - Learn about image generation\n- [Video Generation Guide](../media/video-generation) - Learn about video generation\n"}
